    "body": {
      "en": "### Week 1: Red, Blue, Yellow and Green\n\nChildren explore core colours through real objects, blocks, balls, scarves, crayons, stickers, paint, and classroom hunts. The focus is recognition, choice, matching, and optional colour-word attempts.\n\n### Week 2: One to Five\n\nChildren experience numbers through counting objects, clapping, tapping, jumping, building towers, giving quantities, and simple group routines. The focus is concrete quantity and supported counting.\n\n### Week 3: Matching, Sorting and Same/Different\n\nChildren use colour and number knowledge to match, sort, group, compare same/different, and organise materials into baskets, trays, hoops, or construction spaces.\n\n### Week 4: Colour and Number Play Projects\n\nChildren integrate colour and number in art, music, movement, construction, pretend shops, classroom displays, and clean-up routines: three red blocks, two green stickers, five claps, colour paths, number towers, and shared group projects.",
      "zh": "### Week 1: Red, Blue, Yellow and Green｜第一周：红、蓝、黄和绿\n\n儿童通过真实物品、积木、球、丝巾、蜡笔、贴纸、颜料和课堂寻宝来探索核心颜色。重点是识别、选择、匹配和可选的颜色词尝试。\n\n### Week 2: One to Five｜第二周：一到五\n\n儿童通过数物品、拍手、踏步、跳跃、搭塔、给出数量和简单的集体常规来体验数字。重点是具体数量和支持的数数。\n\n### Week 3: Matching, Sorting and Same/Different｜第三周：匹配、分类和相同／不同\n\n儿童使用颜色和数字知识来匹配、分类、分组、比较相同／不同，以及把材料组织到篮子、托盘、呼啦圈或建构空间中。\n\n### Week 4: Colour and Number Play Projects｜第四周：颜色与数字游戏项目\n\n儿童在艺术、音乐、动作、建构、假装商店、课堂展示和收拾常规中整合颜色和数字：三个红色积木、两个绿色贴纸、五次拍手、颜色路径、数字塔和共享的集体项目。"
    },
