      "en": "### Colour Input\n\nred ｜ blue ｜ yellow ｜ green ｜ colour ｜ same colour ｜ different colour ｜ red one ｜ blue one ｜ green one ｜ show me red ｜ find green ｜ red or blue?\n\n### Number Input\n\none ｜ two ｜ three ｜ four ｜ five ｜ number ｜ count ｜ how many ｜ one more ｜ give me two ｜ give me three ｜ count with me ｜ one, two, three, four, five\n\n### Shape and Object Input\n\ncircle ｜ star ｜ block ｜ ball ｜ crayon ｜ sticker ｜ basket ｜ tray ｜ hoop ｜ tower ｜ big ｜ small\n\n### Teacher Routine Language\n\nLook. ｜ Show me red. ｜ Point to green. ｜ Find yellow. ｜ Red or blue? ｜ Same colour. ｜ Different colour. ｜ Count with me. ｜ Give me three. ｜ How many? ｜ Put it here. ｜ Sort the colours. ｜ Clean up. ｜ Good job. ｜ All done.",
