      "en": "This unit should not become a worksheet-based maths or colour-testing unit.\n\nThis unit may use `What colour?` and `How many?` as teacher input, but children do not need to answer accurately every time.\n\nThis unit should not require written numeral recognition or number writing.\n\nThis unit should keep quantity work concrete and small. Five is the stable PK target; six may appear incidentally through songs or materials.\n\nThis unit should maintain play, movement, sensory exploration, and routine use as the main learning pathway.",
